      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This bug has been more common now and I think I understand why it happens. If something is downloading in the background, like avatars or a previous world, the loading will fail to unpack. So say I load into a world and there is a portal which I go through, but the avatars are still downloading it will cause the bug.",
